#: ../fhir-harness/processes/content/ig-ast-cache.bpmn:70
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Runs the site route's steps via `stage-local.ts` → `build-instance-site.ts`: `ig-site:sidecars` (IG API sidecars, if the landing layer has the step), `ig-site:compose` (artefact index and thin pages from the AST, the IG composed at the root), `ig-site:openapi` (if the IG holds OpenAPI pages), `ig-site:publisher-pages` (the AST's resources as `ast-data/`, the build stamp), and last `ig-site:bar` (the IG's slim bar on pages written after `publisher-pages`). Published at the root from the default branch, as a preview otherwise."
msgstr ""

